#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kruler; is a very simple application, with only one aim in life. To "
#| "measure pixel distances and colors on your screen. It is useful for "
#| "working on layout of dialogs, webpages &etc;"
msgid ""
"&kruler; is a very simple application, with only one aim in life. To measure "
"pixel distances and colors on your screen. It is useful for working on "
"layout of dialogs, web pages &etc;"
msgstr ""
"O &kruler; é unha aplicación moi sinxela cun único obxectivo na vida. Medir "
"distancias entre píxeles e cores na pantalla. É útil cando se traballa no "
"deseño de diálogos, páxinas web, &etc;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To start &kruler;, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Applications</"
#| "guimenu><guisubmenu>Graphics</guisubmenu> <guisubmenu>More Applications</"
#| "guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Screen Ruler</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from "
#| "your &kmenu;."
msgid ""
"To start &kruler;, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Applications</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Graphics</guisubmenu> <guisubmenu>More Applications</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Screen Ruler</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from your "
"application menu."
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o &kruler; vaia a <menuchoice><guimenu>Aplicacións</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Gráficos</guisubmenu> <guisubmenu>Máis aplicacións</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Regra da pantalla</guimenuitem></menuchoice> no "
"&kmenu;."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kruler;</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kruler;</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kruler;</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kruler;</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking with the &LMB; on the &kruler; will turn the cursor to a cross with "
"four arrows and enables you to drag &kruler; around the screen."
msgstr ""
"Ao premer o &kruler; co &LMB; o cursor tórnase unha cruz con catro frechas "
"que permiten arrastrar o &kruler; pola pantalla."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you move the mouse over &kruler;, your cursor will turn into an "
"elongated arrow, with a circle at one end. As you move the cursor, &kruler; "
"will display how far from the point marked <guilabel>0</guilabel> the circle "
"on the end of the cursor currently is. &kruler; will also display the &HTML; "
"color code of the color currently under the circle. This is very useful for "
"picking out colors from an image. If you move the mouse far enough that the "
"arrow cursor is no longer touching &kruler;, the cursor will revert to "
"normal, allowing you to carry on working with your other applications."
msgstr ""
"Canso se move o rato sobre o &kruler; o cursor tórnase unha frecha alongada "
"cun círculo nun extremo. Segundo se move o cursor, o &kruler; mostra a que "
"distancia está do punto marcado <guilabel>0</guilabel> o círculo no final do "
"cursor. O &kruler; tamén mostra o código &HTML; da cor que está baixo o "
"círculo. Isto é moi útil para seleccionar as cores dunha imaxe. Se se move o "
"rato bastante lonxe, de xeito que a frecha do cursor xa non toque o "
"&kruler;, o cursor volve a ser normal, o que permite continuar a traballar "
"coas outras aplicacións."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can change the orientation in three different ways:"
msgstr "Pódese mudar a orientación de tres maneiras distintas:"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking the &MMB; switches the ruler from vertical to horizontal orientation"
msgstr "Premendo o &MMB; cambia a regra da orientación vertical á horizontal"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By clicking the rotation buttons to turn 90 degrees to the left or right. If "
"the rotation buttons are not displayed on the ruler, enable them with "
"<guilabel>Show rotation buttons</guilabel> in the <link linkend=\"settings-"
"dialog\">settings dialog</link>"
msgstr ""
"Premendo os botóns de rotación para xirar 90 graos á esquerda ou á dereita. "
"Se os botóns de rotación non aparecen na regra, actíveos con "
"<guilabel>Mostrar os botóns de rotación</guilabel> no <link linkend="
"\"settings-dialog\">diálogo de configuración</link>"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the context menu, described in the next chapter"
msgstr "Empregando o menú de contexto, que se describe no seguinte capítulo"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Reference"
msgstr "Referencia do menú"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking with the &RMB; on the ruler will pop up a context menu, with the "
"following entries:"
msgstr ""
"Ao premer a regra co &RMB; aparece un menú de contexto coas entradas "
"seguintes:"

#. Tag: guisubmenu
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Orientation"
msgstr "Orientación"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This submenu contains entries that allow you to change the orientation of "
"&kruler;"
msgstr ""
"Este submenú contén entradas que permiten mudar a orientación do &kruler;"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>N</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>North</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>N</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientación</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Norte</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns &kruler; so the ruler is horizontal, and the measurements are on the "
"top (North) of the ruler"
msgstr ""
"Xira o &kruler; para que a regra sexa horizontal e as medidas están na parte "
"superior (Norte) da regra"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>E</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>East</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>E</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientación</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Leste</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns &kruler; so the ruler is vertical, and the measurements are on the "
"right (East) of the ruler"
msgstr ""
"Xira o &kruler; para que a regra sexa vertical e as medidas están na dereita "
"(Leste) da regra"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>S</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>South</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>S</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientación</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Sul</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns &kruler; so the ruler is horizontal, and the measurements are on the "
"bottom (South) of the ruler"
msgstr ""
"xira o &kruler; para que a regra sexa horizontal e as medidas están na parte "
"inferior (Sul) da regra"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>W</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>West</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>W</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientación</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Oeste</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns &kruler; so the ruler is vertical, and the measurements are on the "
"left (West) of the ruler"
msgstr ""
"Xira o &kruler; para que a regra sexa vertical e as medidas están na "
"esquerda (Oeste) da regra)"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>R</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Turn Right</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>R</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientación</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Xirar á dereita</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns the ruler 90 Degrees to the right. For example, if it is oriented "
"South, it will rotate to be oriented West."
msgstr ""
"Xira a regra 90 graos á dereita. Por exemplo, se está orientada para o Sul, "
"xira para estar orientada para o Oeste."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>L</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Turn Left</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>L</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientación</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Xirar á esquerda</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns the ruler 90 Degrees to the left. For example, if it is oriented West, "
"it will rotate to be oriented South."
msgstr ""
"Xira a regra 90 graos á esquerda. Por exemplo, se está orientada para o "
"Oeste, xira para estar orientada para o Sul."

#. Tag: guisubmenu
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Length"
msgstr "Lonxitude"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This submenu contains entries that allow you to change the length of &kruler;"
msgstr ""
"Este submenú contén entradas que permiten alterar a lonxitude do &kruler;"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Length</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Short</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Lonxitude</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Curta</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "Makes &kruler; short - about 385 pixels long."
msgstr "Acurta o &kruler; - arredor duns 385 píxeles."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Length</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Lonxitude</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Media</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "Makes &kruler; a medium length - about 640 pixels long."
msgstr "Dálle un tamaño medio ao &kruler; - arredor duns 640 píxeles."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>T</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Length</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Tall</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>T</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Lonxitude</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Alta</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "Makes &kruler; long - about 960 pixels in length."
msgstr "Alonga o &kruler; - arredor duns 960 píxeles."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Length</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Full Screen Width</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Lonxitude</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Anchura da "
"pantalla</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid "Makes &kruler; the same size as your screen width."
msgstr "Fai que o &kruler; teña o mesmo tamaño que a pantalla."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guisubmenu>Length</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Length...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guisubmenu>Lonxitude</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Lonxitude…</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens a dialog to enter the size in pixel."
msgstr "Abre un diálogo para introducir o tamaño en píxeles."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can change the length and move the right side of the ruler "
"using the mousewheel. When holding the &Shift; key the opposite side will "
"change."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "Escala"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option lets you set the ruler scale to <guilabel>Right to Left</"
"guilabel> (<keycap>D</keycap>), <guilabel>Center Origin</guilabel> "
"(<keycap>C</keycap>), <guilabel>Offset</guilabel> (<keycap>O</keycap>) and "
"<guilabel>Percentage</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Esta opción permite configurar a escala da regra como <guilabel>Dereita a "
"esquerda</guilabel> (<keycap>D</keycap>), <guilabel>Centrar na orixe</"
"guilabel> (<keycap>C</keycap>), <guilabel>Desprazamento</guilabel> "
"(<keycap>O</keycap>) e <guilabel>Porcentaxe</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Changing the offset via the mousewheel is also possible when holding the "
"&LMB;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Opacidade"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "This menu item displays a slider to change the opacity of &kruler;."
msgstr ""
"Este elemento do menú mostra un selector para cambiar a opacidade do "
"&kruler;."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Shortcuts..."
msgstr "Configurar os atallos…"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Configure Shortcut</guilabel> dialog allows you to assign "
"shortcuts to &kruler; actions, and configure the shortcuts already assigned."
msgstr ""
"O diálogo <guilabel>Configurar os atallos</guilabel> permite asignarlles "
"atallos ás accións do &kruler; e configurar os atallos xa asignados."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:328
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information, read the section about the <ulink url=\"help:/"
"fundamentals/config.html#shortcuts\">Shortcuts</ulink> of the &kde; "
"Fundamentals."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure &kruler;..."
msgstr "Configurar &kruler;…"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kruler;'s settings dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Diálogo de configuración do &kruler;</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kruler;'s settings dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Diálogo de configuración do &kruler;</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this dialog you can change the background color and font, enable rotation "
"and close buttons on the ruler and enable the tray icon."
msgstr ""
"Neste diálogo pódese cambiar a cor e o tipo de letra do fondo, activar os "
"botóns de rotación e de pechar na regra e activar a icona da bandexa."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Copy Color</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Copiar a cor</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Copies the &HTML; color code of the color currently under the circle to the "
"clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Copia para o portapapeis o código de cor en &HTML; da cor que estea baixo o "
"círculo."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:375
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>W</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Close</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>W</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Pechar</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:383
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Hides</action> &kruler;. It can be shown again using the icon in the "
"system tray. The context menu displays this item only when <guilabel>Show "
"tray icon</guilabel> is checked in the <link linkend=\"settings-dialog"
"\">settings dialog</link>."
msgstr ""
"<action>Agocha</action> o &kruler;. Pódese mostrar de novo empregando a "
"icona da bandexa do sistema. O menú de contexto mostra este elemento só "
"cando se activa <guilabel>Mostrar a icona da bandexa</guilabel> no <link "
"linkend=\"settings-dialog\">diálogo de configuración</link>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Saír</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &kruler;"
msgstr "<action>Sae</action> do &kruler;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:403
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kruler; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu item, for more "
